### DELETE afiliado sin historial (204)
DELETE {{SistemaCPC.Api_HostAddress}}/api/afiliados/0913
Authorization: Bearer {{directorio.response.body.$.token}}

### DELETE afiliado con historial (409)
DELETE {{SistemaCPC.Api_HostAddress}}/api/afiliados/0457
Authorization: Bearer {{directorio.response.body.$.token}}

